# Project config

Before stack-specific work, read root `package.json` `dependencies`:

| Dependency | Doc |
|---|---|
| `@tanstack/react-start` | `docs/config/tanstack-start.md` |
| `next` (no `@tanstack/react-start`) | `docs/config/nextjs.md` |

Copy only the doc matching the stack chosen at intake. Do not apply one stack's rules (`app/`, `next/image`, `predeploy`) to the other.

Per-project answers (stack, ports, origins, builder yes/no) live in `docs/CONFIG.md` § Stack.
